      "review_description": "I am extremely happy with the final product installation. A 6Kw system with a Fronius inverter and 20 LG 330 watt panels. Although panels were installed early December ,the job was finally finished towards the end of February when the C.C.E.W paperwork was forwarded to my electrical supplier. I would suggest not to have a installation too close to Christmas.. as  problems that could arise (and did ) that were out of Green Homes contol, could not be rectified by the Green Home until later in the new year. I'm looking forward to receiving my next electrcity bill and seeing if it was all worth while .Thanks again Paul.",
